__construct ( $args)

ActionRefreshReposStartup constructor.


This constructor initializes the action to set the scan startup for repositories based on the provided arguments.





Parameters










array$args

An array of arguments where the first argument should be 'git' to trigger the git repository scan startup setting, and the second argument is the value to set for the scan startup. 










